WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.854
Tap Listen, and Michael reads the chapter aloud, highlighting each verse as he goes.

00:00:21.558 --> 00:00:34.230
For translations without a recording, like the Christian Standard Bible, choose a natural voice that's made right on your phone, Ryan or one of the Supertonic voices, from this voice menu.

00:00:35.038 --> 00:00:37.716
Tap the down arrow to tuck the player away.

00:00:37.716 --> 00:00:45.875
Michael keeps reading while you use the rest of the app, even when your screen is locked, and the Study tab follows along with him.

00:00:46.676 --> 00:00:52.715
If you'd rather read at your own pace, tap Scroll, and the page moves gently by itself.

00:00:52.715 --> 00:00:56.255
Use the plus and minus buttons to change the speed.
